---
model: googleai/gemini-2.0-flash
input:
  schema:
    blog_title: string, the title of the post
    author_name: string
    tags(array): string, comma-separated list of tags
    is_published?: boolean, defaults to false
    metadata(object):
      seo_keywords(array): string
      word_count_target: integer, target number of words
---
# Blog Post Generator

Write a detailed blog post titled "{{blog_title}}" by {{author_name}}.

{{#if blog_titlex}}
  The blog post should be centered around the theme of "{{blog_title}}".
{{/if}}

Key Tags: {{tags}}
Target Word Count: {{metadata.word_count_target}}

The SEO strategy should focus on: {{seo_keywords}}

Is this a published version? {{is_published}}
